OL,4,CAnthropic shares fall after            
OL,5,Cblockbuster opening as wider tech sell-
OL,6,Coff continues                          
OL,7,GAnthropic's shares have dropped back   
OL,8,Gtowards their initial price after a    
OL,9,Gsoaring first day on the stock market, 
OL,10,Gas a wider tech sell-off deepens.      
OL,12,FThe fall in tech stocks continued to   
OL,13,Fweigh on markets through Friday, with  
OL,14,Fthe S&P 500 down about 2.8% and the    
OL,15,FDow Jones Industrial Average down more 
OL,16,Fthan 1% by mid-afternoon.              
OL,18,FBoth US indexes touched correction     
OL,19,Fterritory, a point where they are      
OL,20,Ftrading at 10% or more down from a     
OL,21,Frecent high.                           
